This is 1, this is 0.

00:41:27.580 --> 00:41:30.340
But now we're going to make a network a little more complex.

00:41:30.340 --> 00:41:32.545
We're going to add some parameters.

00:41:32.545 --> 00:41:34.510
So I get my picture of the cat.

